LOCATION:Academy Theater\, 7818 SE Stark St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5191;-122.5829
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Graham Moore · 105 min\n\nLeonard is an English tailor wh
 o used to craft suits on London’s world-famous Savile Row. After a perso
 nal tragedy\, he’s ended up in Chicago\, operating a small tailor shop i
 n a rough part of town where he makes beautiful clothes for the only peopl
 e around who can afford them: a family of vicious gangsters.\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://booking.academytheaterpdx.com/launch/ticketing/0535e8d8-e670-5369-9
 f09-61152b188508\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-sc
 reens-pdx/
