 ing you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determine
 d to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in mot
 ion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly
 …but\, with teamwork\, determination and a little bit o’ cluck\, the f
 earless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.\n\n
